{"unit_id":"Andiii208__gzhflow#card-zh","repo":"Andiii208/gzhflow","commit":"3702335770e30ebccc3790556d53aa14c30046f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"gzhflow 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的微信公众号内容工作流插件，通过注册 DSH 工具并随包提供 gzhflow skill，把创作流程接入会话。它提供环境配置检查、去 AI 味与配图提示词质检、Markdown 转公众号 HTML、HTML 校验、图片生成和文章草稿提交。排版工具可选择主题，发布工具支持 dry-run。适合希望用 AI Agent 完成公众号文章制作并将成稿送入草稿箱的用户。使用发布功能需要微信公众号 AppID、AppSecret 和公众号账号；图像生成还需配置 OpenAI 兼容后端与对应凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-preset/tools/gzhflow-tools.mjs:115-175","dsh-preset/tools/gzhflow-tools.mjs:205-315","scripts/md2wechat.py:1-15"]}
{"unit_id":"Andiii208__gzhflow#card-en","repo":"Andiii208/gzhflow","commit":"3702335770e30ebccc3790556d53aa14c30046f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"gzhflow is a DeepSeek Harness web plugin for WeChat article workflows. Its skill and tools check setup, score prose, validate prompts and HTML, format Markdown, generate images, and submit drafts. Publishing needs a WeChat account and credentials; image generation needs a configured backend.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-preset/tools/gzhflow-tools.mjs:115-175","dsh-preset/tools/gzhflow-tools.mjs:205-315","scripts/md2wechat.py:1-15"]}
