{"unit_id":"Andiii208__gzhflow#feature-1","repo":"Andiii208/gzhflow","commit":"3702335770e30ebccc3790556d53aa14c30046f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"gzhflow 的功能「公众号文章排版」：把 Markdown 稿件转换为可粘贴到公众号编辑器的 HTML，并可选择主题与输出路径。通过 gzhflow_md2wechat 工具触发，输入稿件路径，输出排版 HTML 文件路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-preset/tools/gzhflow-tools.mjs:218-230","scripts/md2wechat.py:1-15"]}
{"unit_id":"Andiii208__gzhflow#feature-2","repo":"Andiii208/gzhflow","commit":"3702335770e30ebccc3790556d53aa14c30046f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"gzhflow 的功能「内容与格式质检」：提供去 AI 味文本评分、图片 prompt 检查和公众号 HTML 校验。Agent 调用对应质检工具，输入文本、prompt 或 HTML，得到通过状态及问题明细。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-preset/tools/gzhflow-tools.mjs:177-215"]}
{"unit_id":"Andiii208__gzhflow#feature-3","repo":"Andiii208/gzhflow","commit":"3702335770e30ebccc3790556d53aa14c30046f2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"gzhflow 的功能「生图与草稿提交」：按提示词生成文章图片，或把标题和排版 HTML 提交到公众号草稿箱。调用生图或发布工具，输入提示词与输出路径，或 HTML 路径和标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh-preset/tools/gzhflow-tools.mjs:234-315"]}
